  "text": "proprium.dominica-post-ascensionem-evangelium",
  "about": "The evangelium of the formulary “Sunday after Ascension” in the 1962 Roman Missal.",
  "segments": {
    "s01": { "translation": "At that time Jesus said to His disciples: When the Paraclete cometh, Whom I will send you from the Father, the Spirit of truth Who proceedeth from the Father, He shall give testimony of Me; and you shall give testimony, because you are with Me from the beginning. These things have I spoken to you that you may not be scandalized. They will put you out of the synagogues; yea, the hour cometh that whosoever killeth you will think that he doth a service to God. And these things will they do to you because they have not known the Father nor Me. But these things I have told you, that when the hour shall come you may remember that I told you of them." }
  },
